  m_Name: SC_C2_Awaken
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryCard
  title: "Chim L\u1EA1c th\u1EE9c t\u1EC9nh"
  body: "H\u1EAFc S\u01B0\u01A1ng tan kh\u1ECFi \u0111\xF4i c\xE1nh. Chim L\u1EA1c
    bay v\xF2ng quanh m\u1EB7t tr\u1EDDi tr\xEAn \u0111\u1EC9nh gi\u1EBFng, gi\xF3
    l\xE0nh th\u1ED5i qua l\xF2ng hang.\n\n\"Ba m\u1EA3nh M\u1EB7t Tr\u1EDDi L\xF4ng
    Chim \u0111\xE3 v\u1EC1 ch\u1ED7 c\u0169. Khi g\u1EB7p tr\u1ED1ng b\u1ED1n v\xE0nh,
    v\xE0nh c\u1EE7a ta \u0111\u1EE9ng th\u1EE9 nh\u1EA5t.\"\n\nC\u1ED5ng gi\xF3
    ph\xEDa b\u1EAFc \u0111\xE3 m\u1EDF."
  image: {fileID: 0}
